OL,3,GNEWSAThe 1600s pioneer who challenged
OL,4,Aearth's origins
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 400 years ago natural philosopher
OL,7,Fand writer John Aubrey wrote a huge
OL,8,Fbook about Wiltshire's natural history
OL,9,Fbut the ideas it contained were so
OL,10,Fradical that it was not published in
OL,11,Ffull at the time.
OL,13,FHistorian Dr Louise Ryland-Epton has
OL,14,Fspent the past three years transcribing
OL,15,Fthat book - The Natural History of
OL,16,FWiltshire - which was written in the
OL,17,F1600s and was only part published in
OL,18,Fthe 1800s.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
